    stem: "The graphics show a laptop computer and a wedding cake. These products have been produced as Made-to-Order and Assemble-to-Order items.",
    questionText: "(i) Identify which product was made-to-order. (ii) Explain the difference between Made-to-Order and Assemble-to-Order.",
